* 2005, for the 2006 model year: Toyota expanded the availability of Vehicle Stability Control to XL and Touring trim levels.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.edmunds.com/toyota/avalon/2006/?sub=sedan |title=2006 Toyota Avalon |publisher=Edmunds.com |date=2010-03-09 |access-date=2012-04-08}}</ref>
